### ============================================================
### Reservasi PAA – Contoh Request (.http / REST Client)
### Gunakan ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code, atau konversi ke curl.
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api
### ============================================================

@base = http://localhost:3000/api
# Isi token setelah login berhasil:
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE


# ─── AUTH ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Register user baru
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "Budi@1234",
  "password_confirmation": "Budi@1234"
}

###

### 2. Login admin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@paa.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

###

### 3. Login user
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@paa.local",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

###

### 4. Me (siapa saya)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ─── PROFIL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. Update profil
PUT {{base}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso Updated",
  "email": "budi@example.com"
}

###

### 7. Ganti password
PUT {{base}}/profile/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "Budi@1234",
  "password": "NewPass@5678",
  "password_confirmation": "NewPass@5678"
}


# ─── REFERENSI ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### 8. Daftar batch aktif
GET {{base}}/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. Autocomplete unit kerja
GET {{base}}/work-units?q=Divisi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 10. Dashboard availability kendaraan (hari ini)
GET {{base}}/vehicles/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. Dashboard availability kendaraan (tanggal tertentu)
GET {{base}}/vehicles/availability?date=2026-11-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 12. Kendaraan tersedia untuk dropdown form
GET {{base}}/vehicles/available?date=2026-11-10&batch_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ─── RESERVASI PENGGUNA ──────────────────────────────────────

### 13. Buat reservasi baru
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": 1,
  "batch_id": 1,
  "reservation_date": "2026-11-10",
  "work_unit": "Divisi Pemeliharaan dan Perbaikan",
  "purpose": "Pengiriman Material ke Gudang B"
}

###

### 14. Riwayat reservasi saya
GET {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. Detail / struk reservasi
GET {{base}}/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 16. Batalkan reservasi (hanya jika pending)
POST {{base}}/reservations/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 17. Test double booking – slot yang sama (harus 409)
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": 1,
  "batch_id": 1,
  "reservation_date": "2026-11-10",
  "work_unit": "Divisi Rantai Pasok",
  "purpose": "Angkut Barang – test double booking"
}


# ─── NOTIFIKASI ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 18. Daftar notifikasi
GET {{base}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 19. Badge unread count
GET {{base}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 20. Tandai notif dibaca
POST {{base}}/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 21. Tandai semua dibaca
POST {{base}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ─── ADMIN ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# (gunakan token admin)

### 22. Dashboard admin
GET {{base}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 23. Daftar semua reservasi (admin)
GET {{base}}/admin/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 24. Filter reservasi pending
GET {{base}}/admin/reservations?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 25. Approve reservasi
POST {{base}}/admin/reservations/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 26. Reject reservasi (dengan catatan)
POST {{base}}/admin/reservations/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "admin_note": "Kendaraan sedang dalam perawatan mendadak."
}

###

### 27. Complete reservasi (hanya dari approved)
POST {{base}}/admin/reservations/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 28. Daftar kendaraan (admin)
GET {{base}}/admin/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 29. Daftar user (admin)
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 30. Nonaktifkan user
PATCH {{base}}/admin/users/2/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

###

### 31. Ubah role user
PATCH {{base}}/admin/users/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### 32. Daftar batch (admin – termasuk nonaktif)
GET {{base}}/admin/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 33. Update batch
PUT {{base}}/admin/batches/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Batch 3",
  "start_time": "13:00",
  "end_time": "15:00",
  "is_active": true
}

###

### 34. Laporan mingguan
GET {{base}}/admin/reports?period=weekly&date=2026-11-05
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 35. Laporan harian
GET {{base}}/admin/reports?period=daily&date=2026-11-05
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

